 Week 3 Budget Tracker Documentation
  Key Improvements Overview
Week 3 focused on transforming the raw HTML layout into a polished, card-based finance interface using modern CSS techniques.

Design System (:root Tokens): Added standard CSS variables for an Emerald Green (#059669) primary accent, Slate background (#f8fafc), card fills, and focus rings.

Typography: Integrated Google Fonts—Inter for structural headers/buttons and Plus Jakarta Sans for body copy and inputs.

Header & Logo Badge: Enlarged logo (80px × 80px) inside a rounded, inset-shadowed container (border-radius: 20px).

Form Controls: Added custom padding, rounded corners (8px), full-width layout, and interactive :focus and :hover states.

Styled Expense Table: Formatted data grid with zebra striping (nth-child(even)), right-aligned numeric columns, hover highlights, and rounded overflow clipping.

Card Box-Model Layout: Wrapped major sections (header, .help-guide, <section>) into elevated cards using padding: 24px, light borders, and soft drop shadows.